          {HEADLINE.employmentTroughYear} trough ({HEADLINE.employmentTroughK}k). Average terminal
          dwell rose first ??? up {HEADLINE.dwellRiseHours}h by 2019 ??? about{" "}
          {HEADLINE.dwellLeadYears} years before the employment trough.
        </p>
