              up ~{ANALYTICS.professionalGainPp} pp as PSR closed humps and centralized planning.
            </p>
          </ChartCard>
        </div>
      ) : null}

      <p className="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500">{SOURCE_NOTE}</p>
    </div>
  );
}

